# Gossip's Talent, level 1: "Whenever a creature you control enters, surveil 1." The Talent itself entering is not a creature (no
# surveil, the stack is empty); Bot1's Ornithopter entering surveils: Lightning Bolt goes to the graveyard (CR 701.25a). Bot2's
# Ornithopter entering on turn 2 surveils nothing, the Lightning Bolt in Bot1's graveyard staying alone there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Gossip's Talent
Ornithopter
Island x3
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gossip's Talent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
